              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathtt { R _ { 1 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is the point (11.5, 0), how wide is the door? Do you think this is a comfortable width for the room door? If a person in a wheelchair wants to enter the room, will he/she be able to do so easily?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.684,
            0.884,
            0.727
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) If "
